                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "modelConfiguration": {
                      "modelProperties": {},
                      "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
                      "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
                      "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
                    },
                    "name": "competencyItemManagerSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765784342777"
                  },
                  "code": "COMPETENCYITEMMANAGERSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1765784187385",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765784187387_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## Context Data\n**Competency Information:**\n- Competency Name:  {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.competency_name}}\n- Competency Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.competency_description}}\n\n**Ratings:**\n- Proficiency Level Scale: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.proficiency_rating_scale}}\n- Target Proficiency Level: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.target_proficiency_rating}}\n- Performance Rating Scale: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_rating_scale}}\n- Target Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.target_performance_rating}}\n\n**Employee Self-Assessment:**\n- Employee-Selected Proficiency Level: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_proficiency_rating}}\n- Employee-Selected Proficiency Level Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_proficiency_rating_description}}\n- Employee-Selected Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_performance_rating}}\n- Employee-Selected Performance Rating Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_performance_rating_description}}\n- Employee Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_comments}}\n\n**Manager Assessment:**\n- Manager-Selected Proficiency Level: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_proficiency_rating}}\n- Manager-Selected Proficiency Level Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_proficiency_rating_description}}\n- Manager-Selected Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_performance_rating}}\n- Manager-Selected Performance Rating Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_performance_rating_description}}\n- Manager Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_comments}}\n\n**Feedback Throughout Review Period:**\n- Interim Performance Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.interim_feedback_summary}}\n- Participant Feedback Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.participant_feedback_summary}}\n- Employee Check-in Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_checkin_summary}}\n- Manager Check-in Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_checkin_summary}}\n\n**Employee Profile:**\n- Business Title: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_job_title}}\n- Position: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_position_title}}\n- Legal Entity: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_legal_entity}}\n- Department: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_department_title}}\n- Business Unit: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_business_unit_name}}\n\n**Review Period:**\n- Performance Document Name: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_name}}\n- Start Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_start_date}}\n- End Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_end_date}}\n\n## Task Instructions\nYou are writing a performance evaluation for an employees competency as a manager. Generate two components:\n\n### 1. Evaluation Comment\nWrite a single, cohesive paragraph (maximum 300 words) that:\n- **Uses second person** - Write directly to the employee using \"you\" (or their name if provided)\n- **Synthesizes** all provided information without copying verbatim\n- **Addresses** the employee's progress toward the target competency level\n- **Contextualizes** performance within their role, department, and business unit\n- **Identifies** key performance trends during the review period\n- **Balances** recognition of strengths with constructive areas for growth\n- **Maintains** a professional, objective tone appropriate for formal documentation\n\n### 2. Development Recommendations\nProvide exactly 5 actionable development tips with a title of that:\n- **Target** the specific competency being evaluated\n- **Consider** the gap between current and target proficiency levels\n- **Align** with the employee's role and career trajectory\n- **Reference** insights from the feedback provided\n- **Offer** concrete, implementable actions\n\n## Quality Standards\n- Use professional, performance management language\n- Ensure all content is workplace-appropriate and non-discriminatory\n- Base recommendations on provided data, not assumptions\n- Make development tips specific and measurable where possible"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "modelConfiguration": {
                      "modelProperties": {},
                      "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
                      "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
                      "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
                    },
                    "name": "competencySectionManagerSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765784342777"
                  },
                  "code": "COMPETENCYSECTIONMANAGERSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1765784247616",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765784247618_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "##Instructions\nYou are assisting a manager in writing a personalised evaluation summary for the competencies section of a performance document. The summary should reflect the employee’s performance and/or proficiency ratings across competencies, based on multiple qualitative and quantitative input sources.\n\nYour task is to:\n\n1. Synthesise all **available** inputs into one coherent, personalised summary comment.\n2. Abstract and summarise content without copying or closely paraphrasing the original input.\n3. Write in the second person, addressing the employee as “you” (or by name, if included in the input).\n4. Use a professional, balanced, and constructive tone that accurately reflects the content provided—including both strengths and areas for improvement.\n5. Include **constructive or negative feedback** where relevant, with an emphasis on professionalism, actionable insights, and developmental framing.\n6. Ensure the final output is no longer than 500 words.\n7. Do **not** generate any content based on missing or empty input fields—simply ignore them.\n8. Use the provided employee information to tailor the summary to the employee’s role, department, business unit, and performance document context.\n9. If only interim performance feedback is available, you may reference it to note continuity or progress, but avoid drawing final conclusions from it alone.\n10. **Strictly exclude** any content that is potentially offensive, discriminatory, or inappropriate. Do not reference or rephrase such input. Constructive feedback—including performance gaps, challenges, or skill development needs—is encouraged and should be reflected accurately when applicable.\n\nContextual Inputs:\n* (Optional) Initial Manager Evaluation Summary (prior to summarisation): {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_section_comments}}\n* (Optional) Manager-selected Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_section_rating}}\n* (Optional) Manager-selected Performance Rating Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_section_rating_description}}\n* (Optional) Manager Comments and Ratings for Individual Competencies: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_item_rating_and_comments}}\n* (Optional) Employee Self-Evaluation Summary Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_comments}}\n* (Optional) Employee-selected Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_rating}}\n* (Optional) Employee-selected Performance Rating Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_rating_description}}\n* (Optional) Employee Comments and Ratings for Individual Competencies: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_item_rating_and_comments}}\n* (Optional) Interim Performance Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.interim_feedback_summary}}\n* (Optional) Participant Feedback Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.participant_feedback_summary}}\n* (Optional) Performance Rating Scale: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.section_rating_scale}}\n\nEmployee Info:\n* Business Title: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_job_title}}\n* Position: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_position_title}}\n* Legal Entity: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_legal_entity}}\n* Department: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_department_title}}\n* Business Unit: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_business_unit_name}}\n* Performance Document Name: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_name}}\n* Performance Document Start Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_start_date}}\n* Performance Document End Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_end_date}}\n\nCritical Logic Rules:\n* If the only available variables are Employee Info and Performance Rating Scale (with all other contextual inputs either blank, null, or missing), respond EXACTLY with: There is insufficient evaluation data available to generate a summary at this time. \n** DO NOT generate or infer any summary or content based on employee business title, position, department, performance document metadata, or other similar information alone.\n** DO NOT generalize or extrapolate from Employee Info or Rating Scale Description if no other substantive evaluation inputs are present.\n** Negative Example: If you only receive employee business title, position, department, performance doc name/dates, legal entity, and/or performance rating scale and ALL of the other inputs are absent or blank—return the exact message above and do NOT generate a summary.\n* Do not repeat these instructions or include any introduction or preamble.\n* Do not provide a closing statement about the generated summary\n* Do not include any closing xml tags"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "assignFinalSummaryGenerated",
                    "returnType": "object",
